window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b274-ce186292432c5eb7.json"]={sha256:"ce186292432c5eb7176a9c0cdb44f0d11a8d5aec4757acc0fe5fc894ded2e400",value:{"id":"b274","title":"防洪牆基礎設計","titleEn":"Floodwall foundation design","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"課程串聯靜水合力、揚壓、抗滑、偏心接觸、承載與沉陷，再檢查被動土阻、防滲、接頭及退水反向作用。每個模型明示假設與量綱，區分荷載計算、強度和使用性。比尤德利與波士頓提供工程背景，但本課不把假設尺寸、強度或安全比值當成實際設計或地方核准。","summaryEn":"The course connects hydrostatic force, uplift, sliding, eccentric contact, bearing and settlement before examining passive resistance, cutoffs, joints and recession loads. Each model identifies assumptions and dimensions while distinguishing loading, strength and serviceability. Bewdley and Boston provide engineering context, but assumed dimensions, strengths and resistance ratios are not project designs or local approvals.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-rivers","subcategoryTitle":"輸配水、河川與都市防洪","subcategoryTitleEn":"Water conveyance, rivers and urban flood protection","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-rivers","learningTags":["water","water-rivers","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-river","architectureNodes":[["水位與作用","Water levels and actions"],["底版與揚壓","Footing and uplift"],["接觸與抗力","Contact and resistance"],["沉陷與接頭","Settlement and joints"],["情境與維護","Cases and maintenance"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4]],"diagram":{"type":"water-river","labels":["水位與作用","底版與揚壓","接觸與抗力","沉陷與接頭","情境與維護"],"labelsEn":["Water levels and actions","Footing and uplift","Contact and resistance","Settlement and joints","Cases and maintenance"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"敏感度固定單側靜水、每公尺牆長和水單位重9.81 kN/m³，只把水深從3.0增至3.3 m。合力由44.145增至53.41545 kN/m，增加21%；底部力矩由44.145增至58.7570 kN·m/m，增加33.1%。兩者分別按水深平方和立方變化，不能使用相同百分比。這並不直接給出基礎偏心的新值，因為底版揚壓、垂直水重及其他荷載可能也變動；完整比較必須重新組合相同時刻的各項作用，確認接觸模型仍適用，並獨立檢查承載、滑動與變形。","textEn":"Hold one-sided still water, unit wall length and water unit weight at 9.81 kN/m³ while raising depth from 3.0 to 3.3 m. Force rises from 44.145 to 53.41545 kN/m, an increase of 21%; base moment rises from 44.145 to 58.7570 kN·m/m, an increase of 33.1%. Force and moment scale with depth squared and cubed respectively. This does not directly give a new foundation eccentricity, because uplift, vertical water weight and other loads may also change. A complete comparison recombines all actions at compatible times, confirms the contact model remains applicable and independently checks bearing, sliding and deformation. No acceptance criterion is inferred from the scaling exercise alone.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b274-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證」與「底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification\" and \"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b274-v15-01","title":"靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「靜水荷載與作用點」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hydrostatic load and lever arm” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"防洪牆承受的靜水壓隨水深增加，沿垂直面形成三角形分布，合力與水深平方成正比而底部力矩隨立方改變。荷載必須連到牆身、底版與地基的傳力路徑，不能只以牆頂高度選構件；波浪、漂流物與兩側水位差還需另外建立情境，避免把單側靜水圖當完整設計。本例每公尺牆長、單側淡水、背側乾燥，基底與水深起點相同。忽略動水、土壓和結構自重，結果只是一項外荷載。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「靜水荷載與作用點」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Hydrostatic pressure increases with depth, giving a triangular distribution on a vertical face. Force varies with depth squared and base moment with depth cubed. The load must follow a path through stem, footing and soil, rather than sizing from wall height alone. Waves, debris and differing water levels require separate cases beyond one-sided still water. The example is per metre of wall with freshwater on one side and a dry rear face, measured from the same base. Dynamic water, earth pressure and self-weight are excluded. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hydrostatic load and lever arm” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³、水深h=3 m，合力F=γwh²/2=44.145 kN/m，作用點高h/3=1 m，底矩M=44.145 kN·m/m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume water unit weight 9.81 kN/m³ and depth h=3 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「靜水荷載與作用點」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hydrostatic load and lever arm”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-01-k1","title":"靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證","titleEn":"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification","text":"防洪牆承受的靜水壓隨水深增加，沿垂直面形成三角形分布，合力與水深平方成正比而底部力矩隨立方改變。荷載必須連到牆身、底版與地基的傳力路徑，不能只以牆頂高度選構件；波浪、漂流物與兩側水位差還需另外建立情境，避免把單側靜水圖當完整設計。","textEn":"Hydrostatic pressure increases with depth, giving a triangular distribution on a vertical face. Force varies with depth squared and base moment with depth cubed.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。","防洪牆承受的靜水壓隨水深增加，沿垂直面形成三角形分布，合力與水深平方成正比而底部力矩隨立方改變。","只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。"],"optionsEn":["A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent.","Hydrostatic pressure increases with depth, giving a triangular distribution on a vertical face.","Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability."],"answer":1,"explanation":"防洪牆承受的靜水壓隨水深增加，沿垂直面形成三角形分布，合力與水深平方成正比而底部力矩隨立方改變。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Hydrostatic pressure increases with depth, giving a triangular distribution on a vertical face. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b274-v15-02","title":"靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「靜水荷載與作用點」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hydrostatic load and lever arm” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³、水深h=3 m，合力F=γwh²/2=44.145 kN/m，作用點高h/3=1 m，底矩M=44.145 kN·m/m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume water unit weight 9.81 kN/m³ and depth h=3 m. Force F=44.145 kN/m acts 1 m above the base, producing moment 44.145 kN·m/m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將兩側水位與基底高程放入同一剖面，逐項積分壓力並檢查合力作用點。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place both water levels and the base on one section, integrate pressure and check its resultant location.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³、水深h=3 m，合力F=γwh²/2=44.145 kN/m，作用點高h/3=1 m，底矩M=44.145 kN·m/m。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume water unit weight 9.81 kN/m³ and depth h=3 m. Force F=44.145 kN/m acts 1 m above the base, producing moment 44.145 kN·m/m.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。","計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³、水深h=3 m，合力F=γwh²/2=44.145 kN/m，作用點高h/3=1 m，底矩M=44.145 kN·m/m。"],"optionsEn":["Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable.","Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume water unit weight 9.81 kN/m³ and depth h=3 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³、水深h=3 m，合力F=γwh²/2=44.145 kN/m，作用點高h/3=1 m，底矩M=44.145 kN·m/m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume water unit weight 9.81 kN/m³ and depth h=3 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b274-v15-03","title":"靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「靜水荷載與作用點」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydrostatic load and lever arm” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將兩側水位與基底高程放入同一剖面，逐項積分壓力並檢查合力作用點。列出土壓、波浪及漂流物是否另計，沿牆身到底版追蹤剪力與彎矩，不能只驗算水平力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place both water levels and the base on one section, integrate pressure and check its resultant location. List separate earth, wave and debris contributions and trace shear and bending into the footing instead of checking horizontal force alone as the complete load path. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出不同水深的三角壓力分布並積分合力與力矩，分開列平方和立方比例。再加入背側水位，說明何時應扣除另一個三角形而不是只用水深差平方。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw triangular pressure diagrams for two depths and integrate force and moment, listing square and cube scaling separately. Add rear water and explain why subtracting two triangles differs from squaring only the depth difference.","failure":"注意干擾：把平均壓力作用在半水深會算錯力矩，漏掉背側水位又會誤判方向；使用水深平方比例估力矩會低估水位升高後的彎曲需求及地基偏心。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Applying average pressure at half depth gives the wrong moment, while omitted rear water can reverse the assumed direction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將兩側水位與基底高程放入同一剖面，逐項積分壓力並檢查合力作用點。列出土壓、波浪及漂流物是否另計，沿牆身到底版追蹤剪力與彎矩，不能只驗算水平力。","textEn":"Place both water levels and the base on one section, integrate pressure and check its resultant location. List separate earth, wave and debris contributions and trace shear and bending into the footing instead of checking horizontal force alone as the complete load path.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出不同水深的三角壓力分布並積分合力與力矩，分開列平方和立方比例。再加入背側水位，說明何時應扣除另一個三角形而不是只用水深差平方。","textEn":"Draw triangular pressure diagrams for two depths and integrate force and moment, listing square and cube scaling separately. Add rear water and explain why subtracting two triangles differs from squaring only the depth difference.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification\"?","options":["將兩側水位與基底高程放入同一剖面，逐項積分壓力並檢查合力作用點。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。"],"optionsEn":["Place both water levels and the base on one section, integrate pressure and check its resultant location.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將兩側水位與基底高程放入同一剖面，逐項積分壓力並檢查合力作用點。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place both water levels and the base on one section, integrate pressure and check its resultant location. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b274-v15-04","title":"靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「靜水荷載與作用點」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydrostatic load and lever arm” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把平均壓力作用在半水深會算錯力矩，漏掉背側水位又會誤判方向；使用水深平方比例估力矩會低估水位升高後的彎曲需求及地基偏心。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Applying average pressure at half depth gives the wrong moment, while omitted rear water can reverse the assumed direction. Scaling moment with depth squared understates bending and foundation eccentricity as water rises above the original level. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：忽略動水、土壓和結構自重，結果只是一項外荷載。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Dynamic water, earth pressure and self-weight are excluded.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把平均壓力作用在半水深會算錯力矩，漏掉背側水位又會誤判方向；使用水深平方比例估力矩會低估水位升高後的彎曲需求及地基偏心。","textEn":"Applying average pressure at half depth gives the wrong moment, while omitted rear water can reverse the assumed direction. Scaling moment with depth squared understates bending and foundation eccentricity as water rises above the original level.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「靜水荷載與作用點機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hydrostatic load and lever arm mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","把平均壓力作用在半水深會算錯力矩，漏掉背側水位又會誤判方向；使用水深平方比例估力矩會低估水位升高後的彎曲需求及地基偏心。","只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Applying average pressure at half depth gives the wrong moment, while omitted rear water can reverse the assumed direction.","Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把平均壓力作用在半水深會算錯力矩，漏掉背側水位又會誤判方向；使用水深平方比例估力矩會低估水位升高後的彎曲需求及地基偏心。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying average pressure at half depth gives the wrong moment, while omitted rear water can reverse the assumed direction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b274-v15-05","title":"底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「底版揚壓與合力位置」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Footing uplift and resultant location” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"底版下的孔壓可減少有效向下作用並產生額外力矩，其分布取決於排水、地層及防滲構造，不一定只由兩端水位決定。線性揚壓圖可作教學積分，但排水孔堵塞或局部缺陷可能改變形狀，因此基礎穩定需要同時保留揚壓合力和位置，不能只從自重減一個沒有作用點的總數。本例為每公尺牆長的水平底版，假設揚壓沿寬度線性由高端降到低端；不是由兩個端點自動證明的現場壓力分布。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「底版揚壓與合力位置」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pore pressure beneath a footing reduces effective downward load and contributes moment. Its distribution depends on drainage, strata and cutoffs rather than endpoint stages alone. A linear diagram is useful for integration, but blocked drains and defects can alter its shape. Stability therefore needs both uplift magnitude and location, not merely a scalar deduction from weight. This is a horizontal footing per metre of wall with assumed linear uplift from high to low edge. Two endpoint observations do not automatically prove that distribution in the field. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Footing uplift and resultant location” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設底寬B=4 m，高低端揚壓p1=30、p2=10 kPa，U=(p1+p2)B/2=80 kN/m，合力距高壓端1.667 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume width B=4 m and edge uplifts p1=30, p2=10 kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「底版揚壓與合力位置」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Footing uplift and resultant location”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-05-k1","title":"底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證","titleEn":"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification","text":"底版下的孔壓可減少有效向下作用並產生額外力矩，其分布取決於排水、地層及防滲構造，不一定只由兩端水位決定。線性揚壓圖可作教學積分，但排水孔堵塞或局部缺陷可能改變形狀，因此基礎穩定需要同時保留揚壓合力和位置，不能只從自重減一個沒有作用點的總數。","textEn":"Pore pressure beneath a footing reduces effective downward load and contributes moment. Its distribution depends on drainage, strata and cutoffs rather than endpoint stages alone.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。","底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。","底版下的孔壓可減少有效向下作用並產生額外力矩，其分布取決於排水、地層及防滲構造，不一定只由兩端水位決定。"],"optionsEn":["Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability.","Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift.","Pore pressure beneath a footing reduces effective downward load and contributes moment."],"answer":2,"explanation":"底版下的孔壓可減少有效向下作用並產生額外力矩，其分布取決於排水、地層及防滲構造，不一定只由兩端水位決定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pore pressure beneath a footing reduces effective downward load and contributes moment. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b274-v15-06","title":"底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「底版揚壓與合力位置」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Footing uplift and resultant location” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設底寬B=4 m，高低端揚壓p1=30、p2=10 kPa，U=(p1+p2)B/2=80 kN/m，合力距高壓端1.667 m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume width B=4 m and edge uplifts p1=30, p2=10 kPa. U=(p1+p2)B/2=80 kN/m; its resultant is 1.667 m from the high-pressure edge. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：把揚壓圖拆成矩形與三角形分別求合力和力矩，核對端點方向與座標。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Split the uplift diagram into rectangular and triangular parts, checking force, moment and coordinate orientation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設底寬B=4 m，高低端揚壓p1=30、p2=10 kPa，U=(p1+p2)B/2=80 kN/m，合力距高壓端1.667 m。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume width B=4 m and edge uplifts p1=30, p2=10 kPa. U=(p1+p2)B/2=80 kN/m; its resultant is 1.667 m from the high-pressure edge.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設底寬B=4 m，高低端揚壓p1=30、p2=10 kPa，U=(p1+p2)B/2=80 kN/m，合力距高壓端1.667 m。","極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。","朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume width B=4 m and edge uplifts p1=30, p2=10 kPa.","Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks.","Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設底寬B=4 m，高低端揚壓p1=30、p2=10 kPa，U=(p1+p2)B/2=80 kN/m，合力距高壓端1.667 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume width B=4 m and edge uplifts p1=30, p2=10 kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b274-v15-07","title":"底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「底版揚壓與合力位置」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Footing uplift and resultant location” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"把揚壓圖拆成矩形與三角形分別求合力和力矩，核對端點方向與座標。用底版下多點孔壓檢查形狀，另外分析排水失效及洪水快速變化，避免只用正常排水圖。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Split the uplift diagram into rectangular and triangular parts, checking force, moment and coordinate orientation. Compare its shape with several under-footing pressures and analyze drainage failure and rapid stage changes separately instead of carrying only the normal-drainage assumption into stability calculations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用相同揚壓總力配置兩個不同壓力圖，計算各自對底邊力矩。列出新增中間孔壓測點能排除的假設，說明為何只量兩端仍有未解不確定性。","observationEn":"Site practice: Construct two uplift diagrams with equal force and calculate their moments about one edge. List assumptions that an intermediate pressure measurement can test and explain uncertainty remaining when only endpoint pressures are known.","failure":"注意干擾：錯置合力位置會讓抗傾覆帳失真，直接以背水側低壓套全底版則可能低估揚壓；若排水管堵塞仍沿用原圖，滑動及接觸壓力的有效載重都會過於樂觀。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A misplaced uplift resultant distorts overturning balance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把揚壓圖拆成矩形與三角形分別求合力和力矩，核對端點方向與座標。用底版下多點孔壓檢查形狀，另外分析排水失效及洪水快速變化，避免只用正常排水圖。","textEn":"Split the uplift diagram into rectangular and triangular parts, checking force, moment and coordinate orientation. Compare its shape with several under-footing pressures and analyze drainage failure and rapid stage changes separately instead of carrying only the normal-drainage assumption into stability calculations.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用相同揚壓總力配置兩個不同壓力圖，計算各自對底邊力矩。列出新增中間孔壓測點能排除的假設，說明為何只量兩端仍有未解不確定性。","textEn":"Construct two uplift diagrams with equal force and calculate their moments about one edge. List assumptions that an intermediate pressure measurement can test and explain uncertainty remaining when only endpoint pressures are known.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","把揚壓圖拆成矩形與三角形分別求合力和力矩，核對端點方向與座標。","兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Split the uplift diagram into rectangular and triangular parts, checking force, moment and coordinate orientation.","Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把揚壓圖拆成矩形與三角形分別求合力和力矩，核對端點方向與座標。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Split the uplift diagram into rectangular and triangular parts, checking force, moment and coordinate orientation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b274-v15-08","title":"底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「底版揚壓與合力位置」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Footing uplift and resultant location” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"錯置合力位置會讓抗傾覆帳失真，直接以背水側低壓套全底版則可能低估揚壓；若排水管堵塞仍沿用原圖，滑動及接觸壓力的有效載重都會過於樂觀。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A misplaced uplift resultant distorts overturning balance. Applying only the low rear pressure across the base understates uplift, and retaining a drained diagram after blockage overstates the effective loads available for sliding resistance and bearing contact. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例為每公尺牆長的水平底版，假設揚壓沿寬度線性由高端降到低端；不是由兩個端點自動證明的現場壓力分布。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Two endpoint observations do not automatically prove that distribution in the field.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"錯置合力位置會讓抗傾覆帳失真，直接以背水側低壓套全底版則可能低估揚壓；若排水管堵塞仍沿用原圖，滑動及接觸壓力的有效載重都會過於樂觀。","textEn":"A misplaced uplift resultant distorts overturning balance. Applying only the low rear pressure across the base understates uplift, and retaining a drained diagram after blockage overstates the effective loads available for sliding resistance and bearing contact.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「底版揚壓與合力位置機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Footing uplift and resultant location mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。","錯置合力位置會讓抗傾覆帳失真，直接以背水側低壓套全底版則可能低估揚壓；若排水管堵塞仍沿用原圖，滑動及接觸壓力的有效載重都會過於樂觀。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift.","A misplaced uplift resultant distorts overturning balance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"錯置合力位置會讓抗傾覆帳失真，直接以背水側低壓套全底版則可能低估揚壓；若排水管堵塞仍沿用原圖，滑動及接觸壓力的有效載重都會過於樂觀。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A misplaced uplift resultant distorts overturning balance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b274-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證」與「偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification\" and \"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b274-v15-09","title":"有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「有效法向力與滑動」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Effective normal load and sliding” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"底版摩擦取決於接觸面的有效法向作用，揚壓會減少可用摩擦力，不能一面以浮重計自重又重複扣除全部揚壓。界面強度、黏著與前方被動土阻力需有相應證據及可動員變形；受沖刷或未來開挖影響的土體也不能無條件當永久抗力。本例自重採未扣揚壓的總向下力，只考慮無黏著庫侖摩擦，未計土被動阻力或錨定；所得為指定機理的比值，非規範驗收。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「有效法向力與滑動」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Base friction depends on effective normal action, which uplift reduces. Weight and buoyancy conventions must avoid deducting the same water effect twice. Interface strength, adhesion and passive soil resistance require evidence and compatible mobilization movements. Soil exposed to scour or future excavation cannot automatically be credited as permanent resistance in a sliding assessment. The example starts with gross downward weight and includes cohesionless Coulomb interface friction only, excluding passive resistance and anchorage. The resulting mechanism ratio is not a code acceptance decision. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Effective normal load and sliding” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設總向下力W=200 kN/m、揚壓U=80 kN/m、μ=0.50、水平H=40 kN/m，R=μ(W−U)=60 kN/m，R/H=1.50。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume gross W=200 kN/m, uplift U=80 kN/m, friction μ=0.50 and horizontal H=40 kN/m.","failure":"常見誤解：「底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「有效法向力與滑動」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Effective normal load and sliding”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-09-k1","title":"有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證","titleEn":"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification","text":"底版摩擦取決於接觸面的有效法向作用，揚壓會減少可用摩擦力，不能一面以浮重計自重又重複扣除全部揚壓。界面強度、黏著與前方被動土阻力需有相應證據及可動員變形；受沖刷或未來開挖影響的土體也不能無條件當永久抗力。","textEn":"Base friction depends on effective normal action, which uplift reduces. Weight and buoyancy conventions must avoid deducting the same water effect twice.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["底版摩擦取決於接觸面的有效法向作用，揚壓會減少可用摩擦力，不能一面以浮重計自重又重複扣除全部揚壓。","底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。","底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。"],"optionsEn":["Base friction depends on effective normal action, which uplift reduces.","Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift.","Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable."],"answer":0,"explanation":"底版摩擦取決於接觸面的有效法向作用，揚壓會減少可用摩擦力，不能一面以浮重計自重又重複扣除全部揚壓。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Base friction depends on effective normal action, which uplift reduces. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b274-v15-10","title":"有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「有效法向力與滑動」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Effective normal load and sliding” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設總向下力W=200 kN/m、揚壓U=80 kN/m、μ=0.50、水平H=40 kN/m，R=μ(W−U)=60 kN/m，R/H=1.50。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume gross W=200 kN/m, uplift U=80 kN/m, friction μ=0.50 and horizontal H=40 kN/m. Resistance R=60 kN/m and ratio R/H=1.50. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對重量與揚壓是否採相容定義，檢查界面試驗、粗糙度與施工接觸條件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check consistent weight/uplift definitions and evidence for interface behavior, roughness and construction contact.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設總向下力W=200 kN/m、揚壓U=80 kN/m、μ=0.50、水平H=40 kN/m，R=μ(W−U)=60 kN/m，R/H=1.50。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume gross W=200 kN/m, uplift U=80 kN/m, friction μ=0.50 and horizontal H=40 kN/m. Resistance R=60 kN/m and ratio R/H=1.50.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設總向下力W=200 kN/m、揚壓U=80 kN/m、μ=0.50、水平H=40 kN/m，R=μ(W−U)=60 kN/m，R/H=1.50。","防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。"],"optionsEn":["Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume gross W=200 kN/m, uplift U=80 kN/m, friction μ=0.50 and horizontal H=40 kN/m.","A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設總向下力W=200 kN/m、揚壓U=80 kN/m、μ=0.50、水平H=40 kN/m，R=μ(W−U)=60 kN/m，R/H=1.50。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume gross W=200 kN/m, uplift U=80 kN/m, friction μ=0.50 and horizontal H=40 kN/m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b274-v15-11","title":"有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「有效法向力與滑動」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Effective normal load and sliding” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對重量與揚壓是否採相容定義，檢查界面試驗、粗糙度與施工接觸條件。列明未採用的黏著和被動抗力，另考慮沖刷、排水失效及反向荷載，不把計算比值直接標示合格。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check consistent weight/uplift definitions and evidence for interface behavior, roughness and construction contact. Identify excluded adhesion and passive resistance, and assess scour, failed drainage and reversed loading separately rather than treating a computed resistance ratio as an automatic compliance result. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用同一牆重比較兩種揚壓的抗滑比，清楚列出未採用的抗力。再移除前方可能沖刷的土體，說明為何抗力必須符合相同荷載情境與變形條件。","observationEn":"Site practice: Compare sliding ratios at two uplifts for the same wall weight, identifying excluded resistances. Remove potentially scoured front soil and explain why resistance must correspond to the same load case and compatible movement conditions.","failure":"注意干擾：用總自重計摩擦而忽略揚壓會高估抗力，將浮重再減全揚壓則可能重複扣水效應；把會被沖走的土算成永久被動抗力，也會隱藏失去支承後的滑動風險。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using gross weight for friction ignores uplift, while subtracting full uplift from an already buoyant weight can double-count water. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對重量與揚壓是否採相容定義，檢查界面試驗、粗糙度與施工接觸條件。列明未採用的黏著和被動抗力，另考慮沖刷、排水失效及反向荷載，不把計算比值直接標示合格。","textEn":"Check consistent weight/uplift definitions and evidence for interface behavior, roughness and construction contact. Identify excluded adhesion and passive resistance, and assess scour, failed drainage and reversed loading separately rather than treating a computed resistance ratio as an automatic compliance result.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用同一牆重比較兩種揚壓的抗滑比，清楚列出未採用的抗力。再移除前方可能沖刷的土體，說明為何抗力必須符合相同荷載情境與變形條件。","textEn":"Compare sliding ratios at two uplifts for the same wall weight, identifying excluded resistances. Remove potentially scoured front soil and explain why resistance must correspond to the same load case and compatible movement conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。","核對重量與揚壓是否採相容定義，檢查界面試驗、粗糙度與施工接觸條件。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together.","Check consistent weight/uplift definitions and evidence for interface behavior, roughness and construction contact."],"answer":2,"explanation":"核對重量與揚壓是否採相容定義，檢查界面試驗、粗糙度與施工接觸條件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check consistent weight/uplift definitions and evidence for interface behavior, roughness and construction contact. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b274-v15-12","title":"有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「有效法向力與滑動」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Effective normal load and sliding” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"用總自重計摩擦而忽略揚壓會高估抗力，將浮重再減全揚壓則可能重複扣水效應；把會被沖走的土算成永久被動抗力，也會隱藏失去支承後的滑動風險。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using gross weight for friction ignores uplift, while subtracting full uplift from an already buoyant weight can double-count water. Crediting scour-prone soil as permanent passive resistance hides the change in sliding response after support is lost. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例自重採未扣揚壓的總向下力，只考慮無黏著庫侖摩擦，未計土被動阻力或錨定；所得為指定機理的比值，非規範驗收。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The resulting mechanism ratio is not a code acceptance decision.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用總自重計摩擦而忽略揚壓會高估抗力，將浮重再減全揚壓則可能重複扣水效應；把會被沖走的土算成永久被動抗力，也會隱藏失去支承後的滑動風險。","textEn":"Using gross weight for friction ignores uplift, while subtracting full uplift from an already buoyant weight can double-count water. Crediting scour-prone soil as permanent passive resistance hides the change in sliding response after support is lost.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「有效法向力與滑動機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Effective normal load and sliding mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["用總自重計摩擦而忽略揚壓會高估抗力，將浮重再減全揚壓則可能重複扣水效應；把會被沖走的土算成永久被動抗力，也會隱藏失去支承後的滑動風險。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。"],"optionsEn":["Using gross weight for friction ignores uplift, while subtracting full uplift from an already buoyant weight can double-count water.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用總自重計摩擦而忽略揚壓會高估抗力，將浮重再減全揚壓則可能重複扣水效應；把會被沖走的土算成永久被動抗力，也會隱藏失去支承後的滑動風險。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using gross weight for friction ignores uplift, while subtracting full uplift from an already buoyant weight can double-count water. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b274-v15-13","title":"偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「偏心與底面接觸」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Eccentricity and footing contact” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"合力偏離底版中心會使接觸壓力一側升高另一側降低，在剛性底版與線彈性全接觸近似下可由軸力和力矩估算邊緣壓力。當計算出拉應力時，土通常不能提供所假設的拉力，須改用部分接觸模型；全接觸公式的負值不是可忽略的小數，而是模型邊界已改變的訊號。本例所有載重已含水力效應，N為有效淨向下力、M為對中心的淨力矩，每公尺牆長計。只檢查全接觸線性壓力，不評定承載強度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「偏心與底面接觸」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An eccentric resultant raises contact stress at one edge and lowers it at the other. A rigid footing with linear full contact permits edge stresses from axial force and moment. Calculated tension usually cannot be sustained by soil, requiring a partial-contact model. A negative full-contact stress signals a changed boundary rather than a harmless numerical artifact. All hydraulic effects are included: N is net effective downward action and M its net moment about the center, per metre of wall. This checks linear full contact only, not bearing strength. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Eccentricity and footing contact” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設B=4 m、N=120 kN/m、M=60 kN·m/m，e=M/N=0.50 m；qmax,min=N/B(1±6e/B)=52.5、7.5 kPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume B=4 m, N=120 kN/m and M=60 kN·m/m.","failure":"常見誤解：「底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「偏心與底面接觸」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Eccentricity and footing contact”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-13-k1","title":"偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證","titleEn":"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification","text":"合力偏離底版中心會使接觸壓力一側升高另一側降低，在剛性底版與線彈性全接觸近似下可由軸力和力矩估算邊緣壓力。當計算出拉應力時，土通常不能提供所假設的拉力，須改用部分接觸模型；全接觸公式的負值不是可忽略的小數，而是模型邊界已改變的訊號。","textEn":"An eccentric resultant raises contact stress at one edge and lowers it at the other. A rigid footing with linear full contact permits edge stresses from axial force and moment.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。","合力偏離底版中心會使接觸壓力一側升高另一側降低，在剛性底版與線彈性全接觸近似下可由軸力和力矩估算邊緣壓力。","極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。"],"optionsEn":["Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable.","An eccentric resultant raises contact stress at one edge and lowers it at the other.","Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks."],"answer":1,"explanation":"合力偏離底版中心會使接觸壓力一側升高另一側降低，在剛性底版與線彈性全接觸近似下可由軸力和力矩估算邊緣壓力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An eccentric resultant raises contact stress at one edge and lowers it at the other. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b274-v15-14","title":"偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「偏心與底面接觸」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Eccentricity and footing contact” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設B=4 m、N=120 kN/m、M=60 kN·m/m，e=M/N=0.50 m；qmax,min=N/B(1±6e/B)=52.5、7.5 kPa。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume B=4 m, N=120 kN/m and M=60 kN·m/m. Eccentricity e=0.50 m; full-contact edge pressures are qmax=52.5 and qmin=7.5 kPa. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以一致中心座標加總所有力矩，核對偏心距與B/6的全壓接觸界限。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Sum moments about a consistent center and compare eccentricity with the B/6 full-compression limit.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設B=4 m、N=120 kN/m、M=60 kN·m/m，e=M/N=0.50 m；qmax,min=N/B(1±6e/B)=52.5、7.5 kPa。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume B=4 m, N=120 kN/m and M=60 kN·m/m. Eccentricity e=0.50 m; full-contact edge pressures are qmax=52.5 and qmin=7.5 kPa.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。","兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設B=4 m、N=120 kN/m、M=60 kN·m/m，e=M/N=0.50 m。"],"optionsEn":["Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance.","Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume B=4 m, N=120 kN/m and M=60 kN·m/m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設B=4 m、N=120 kN/m、M=60 kN·m/m，e=M/N=0.50 m；qmax,min=N/B(1±6e/B)=52.5、7.5 kPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume B=4 m, N=120 kN/m and M=60 kN·m/m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b274-v15-15","title":"偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「偏心與底面接觸」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Eccentricity and footing contact” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以一致中心座標加總所有力矩，核對偏心距與B/6的全壓接觸界限。檢查底版剛度、地層均勻性和壓力分布假設，再另做承載、沉陷及結構驗算，避免把正壓力當全面安全。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Sum moments about a consistent center and compare eccentricity with the B/6 full-compression limit. Check footing rigidity, soil uniformity and the assumed pressure distribution, then assess bearing, settlement and structural response separately instead of interpreting positive contact stress as comprehensive safety. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：逐步增加中心力矩，找出最小接觸壓力變成零的點並停止全接觸外推。列出此後需要的接觸幾何與地基資訊，區分壓力分布和承載強度問題。","observationEn":"Site practice: Increase center moment until minimum contact stress reaches zero and stop full-contact extrapolation. List the contact geometry and soil information needed afterward, distinguishing stress-distribution questions from soil bearing-strength questions.","failure":"注意干擾：把外水水平力矩與揚壓力矩漏算或重算會改變偏心，使用部分接觸時仍保留全寬線性壓力則可能低估峰值；正的最小壓力也不能證明地基承載或沉陷足夠。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Omitted or duplicated water moments alter eccentricity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以一致中心座標加總所有力矩，核對偏心距與B/6的全壓接觸界限。檢查底版剛度、地層均勻性和壓力分布假設，再另做承載、沉陷及結構驗算，避免把正壓力當全面安全。","textEn":"Sum moments about a consistent center and compare eccentricity with the B/6 full-compression limit. Check footing rigidity, soil uniformity and the assumed pressure distribution, then assess bearing, settlement and structural response separately instead of interpreting positive contact stress as comprehensive safety.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"逐步增加中心力矩，找出最小接觸壓力變成零的點並停止全接觸外推。列出此後需要的接觸幾何與地基資訊，區分壓力分布和承載強度問題。","textEn":"Increase center moment until minimum contact stress reaches zero and stop full-contact extrapolation. List the contact geometry and soil information needed afterward, distinguishing stress-distribution questions from soil bearing-strength questions.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification\"?","options":["以一致中心座標加總所有力矩，核對偏心距與B/6的全壓接觸界限。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。"],"optionsEn":["Sum moments about a consistent center and compare eccentricity with the B/6 full-compression limit.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以一致中心座標加總所有力矩，核對偏心距與B/6的全壓接觸界限。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Sum moments about a consistent center and compare eccentricity with the B/6 full-compression limit. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b274-v15-16","title":"偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「偏心與底面接觸」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Eccentricity and footing contact” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把外水水平力矩與揚壓力矩漏算或重算會改變偏心，使用部分接觸時仍保留全寬線性壓力則可能低估峰值；正的最小壓力也不能證明地基承載或沉陷足夠。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Omitted or duplicated water moments alter eccentricity. Retaining a full-width pressure model after contact is lost can understate peak stress, while a positive minimum stress says nothing by itself about bearing capacity or acceptable settlement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：只檢查全接觸線性壓力，不評定承載強度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This checks linear full contact only, not bearing strength.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把外水水平力矩與揚壓力矩漏算或重算會改變偏心，使用部分接觸時仍保留全寬線性壓力則可能低估峰值；正的最小壓力也不能證明地基承載或沉陷足夠。","textEn":"Omitted or duplicated water moments alter eccentricity. Retaining a full-width pressure model after contact is lost can understate peak stress, while a positive minimum stress says nothing by itself about bearing capacity or acceptable settlement.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「偏心與底面接觸機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Eccentricity and footing contact mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","把外水水平力矩與揚壓力矩漏算或重算會改變偏心，使用部分接觸時仍保留全寬線性壓力則可能低估峰值；正的最小壓力也不能證明地基承載或沉陷足夠。","極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Omitted or duplicated water moments alter eccentricity.","Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把外水水平力矩與揚壓力矩漏算或重算會改變偏心，使用部分接觸時仍保留全寬線性壓力則可能低估峰值；正的最小壓力也不能證明地基承載或沉陷足夠。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Omitted or duplicated water moments alter eccentricity. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b274-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證」與「基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification\" and \"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b274-v15-17","title":"黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「黏土承載模式篩選」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Undrained clay bearing screening” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"地基承載破壞與正常使用沉陷不同，短期飽和黏土可在特定幾何下以不排水強度建立承載尺度。承載係數會隨形狀、埋深、荷載傾斜、地面坡度與土層變化，不能將無埋深條形基礎的簡式套所有防洪牆；偏心和揚壓還必須先以相容方式納入作用。本例水平地面、地表無限長條形基礎、均質不排水黏土及垂直置中荷載，取理想Nc=5.14；是淨極限承載力，不是容許壓力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「黏土承載模式篩選」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Bearing failure differs from service settlement. Short-term saturated clay can provide an undrained bearing scale under specific geometry. Coefficients vary with shape, embedment, load inclination, ground slope and layering, so a surface strip-footing expression is not universal for floodwalls. Eccentricity and uplift also require compatible treatment in the applied actions. The example assumes level ground, a surface strip footing, uniform undrained clay and centered vertical loading with ideal Nc=5.14. It gives net ultimate bearing capacity, not allowable pressure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Undrained clay bearing screening” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設不排水強度su=40 kPa、Nc=5.14，淨極限承載力qnet,ult=Ncsu=205.6 kPa；未施安全係數或折減。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume undrained strength su=40 kPa and Nc=5.14.","failure":"常見誤解：「極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「黏土承載模式篩選」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Undrained clay bearing screening”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-17-k1","title":"黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證","titleEn":"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification","text":"地基承載破壞與正常使用沉陷不同，短期飽和黏土可在特定幾何下以不排水強度建立承載尺度。承載係數會隨形狀、埋深、荷載傾斜、地面坡度與土層變化，不能將無埋深條形基礎的簡式套所有防洪牆；偏心和揚壓還必須先以相容方式納入作用。","textEn":"Bearing failure differs from service settlement. Short-term saturated clay can provide an undrained bearing scale under specific geometry.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。","計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。","地基承載破壞與正常使用沉陷不同，短期飽和黏土可在特定幾何下以不排水強度建立承載尺度。"],"optionsEn":["Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks.","Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.","Bearing failure differs from service settlement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"地基承載破壞與正常使用沉陷不同，短期飽和黏土可在特定幾何下以不排水強度建立承載尺度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Bearing failure differs from service settlement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b274-v15-18","title":"黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「黏土承載模式篩選」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Undrained clay bearing screening” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設不排水強度su=40 kPa、Nc=5.14，淨極限承載力qnet,ult=Ncsu=205.6 kPa；未施安全係數或折減。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume undrained strength su=40 kPa and Nc=5.14. Ideal net ultimate bearing qnet,ult=Ncsu=205.6 kPa, before any safety factor or reduction. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：檢查強度測試的應力路徑、取樣擾動及地層代表性，辨識短期與長期排水狀態。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check the strength-test stress path, sample disturbance and representativeness and distinguish short-term from long-term drainage.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設不排水強度su=40 kPa、Nc=5.14，淨極限承載力qnet,ult=Ncsu=205.6 kPa；未施安全係數或折減。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume undrained strength su=40 kPa and Nc=5.14. Ideal net ultimate bearing qnet,ult=Ncsu=205.6 kPa, before any safety factor or reduction.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設不排水強度su=40 kPa、Nc=5.14，淨極限承載力qnet,ult=Ncsu=205.6 kPa。","防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。","外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume undrained strength su=40 kPa and Nc=5.14.","A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location.","Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設不排水強度su=40 kPa、Nc=5.14，淨極限承載力qnet,ult=Ncsu=205.6 kPa；未施安全係數或折減。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume undrained strength su=40 kPa and Nc=5.14. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b274-v15-19","title":"黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「黏土承載模式篩選」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Undrained clay bearing screening” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"檢查強度測試的應力路徑、取樣擾動及地層代表性，辨識短期與長期排水狀態。若偏心、傾斜或分層不符簡式，改用相應模型；再獨立驗算沉陷，不能把極限承載值當使用壓力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check the strength-test stress path, sample disturbance and representativeness and distinguish short-term from long-term drainage. Replace the simple expression where eccentricity, inclination or layering violate assumptions, and independently assess settlement rather than using ultimate capacity as a service-pressure recommendation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：建立淨壓力與總壓力的對照，再列出條形基礎簡式缺少的幾何修正。提出能辨識軟弱下層的調查配置，並說明強度資料為何不能獨自決定使用性。","observationEn":"Site practice: Compare net and gross pressure definitions and list geometric corrections missing from the strip-footing expression. Propose investigation capable of finding a weak lower layer and explain why strength data cannot alone establish serviceability.","failure":"注意干擾：把淨極限承載力直接與未整理的總壓力相比會混淆定義，軟弱下臥層也可能控制破壞；即使承載強度有餘量，長期壓密仍可能使接縫和止水失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Comparing net ultimate capacity with an inconsistent gross stress confuses definitions, and a weak underlying layer may control failure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"檢查強度測試的應力路徑、取樣擾動及地層代表性，辨識短期與長期排水狀態。若偏心、傾斜或分層不符簡式，改用相應模型；再獨立驗算沉陷，不能把極限承載值當使用壓力。","textEn":"Check the strength-test stress path, sample disturbance and representativeness and distinguish short-term from long-term drainage. Replace the simple expression where eccentricity, inclination or layering violate assumptions, and independently assess settlement rather than using ultimate capacity as a service-pressure recommendation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"建立淨壓力與總壓力的對照，再列出條形基礎簡式缺少的幾何修正。提出能辨識軟弱下層的調查配置，並說明強度資料為何不能獨自決定使用性。","textEn":"Compare net and gross pressure definitions and list geometric corrections missing from the strip-footing expression. Propose investigation capable of finding a weak lower layer and explain why strength data cannot alone establish serviceability.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","檢查強度測試的應力路徑、取樣擾動及地層代表性，辨識短期與長期排水狀態。","只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Check the strength-test stress path, sample disturbance and representativeness and distinguish short-term from long-term drainage.","Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability."],"answer":1,"explanation":"檢查強度測試的應力路徑、取樣擾動及地層代表性，辨識短期與長期排水狀態。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check the strength-test stress path, sample disturbance and representativeness and distinguish short-term from long-term drainage. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b274-v15-20","title":"黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「黏土承載模式篩選」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Undrained clay bearing screening” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把淨極限承載力直接與未整理的總壓力相比會混淆定義，軟弱下臥層也可能控制破壞；即使承載強度有餘量，長期壓密仍可能使接縫和止水失效。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Comparing net ultimate capacity with an inconsistent gross stress confuses definitions, and a weak underlying layer may control failure. Even with bearing-strength reserve, long-term consolidation can impair wall joints and waterstops through differential movement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例水平地面、地表無限長條形基礎、均質不排水黏土及垂直置中荷載，取理想Nc=5.14；是淨極限承載力，不是容許壓力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: It gives net ultimate bearing capacity, not allowable pressure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把淨極限承載力直接與未整理的總壓力相比會混淆定義，軟弱下臥層也可能控制破壞；即使承載強度有餘量，長期壓密仍可能使接縫和止水失效。","textEn":"Comparing net ultimate capacity with an inconsistent gross stress confuses definitions, and a weak underlying layer may control failure. Even with bearing-strength reserve, long-term consolidation can impair wall joints and waterstops through differential movement.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「黏土承載模式篩選機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Undrained clay bearing screening mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。","把淨極限承載力直接與未整理的總壓力相比會混淆定義，軟弱下臥層也可能控制破壞；即使承載強度有餘量，長期壓密仍可能使接縫和止水失效。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.","Comparing net ultimate capacity with an inconsistent gross stress confuses definitions, and a weak underlying layer may control failure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把淨極限承載力直接與未整理的總壓力相比會混淆定義，軟弱下臥層也可能控制破壞；即使承載強度有餘量，長期壓密仍可能使接縫和止水失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Comparing net ultimate capacity with an inconsistent gross stress confuses definitions, and a weak underlying layer may control failure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b274-v15-21","title":"基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「基礎彈性變形尺度」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Elastic foundation deformation scale” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"牆基即使未達承載破壞也會變形，沉陷差可能使板段接頭張開或頂高失去餘量。彈性半空間公式可展示壓力、寬度與剛度的比例關係，但土模數與應力水準、排水時間及應變大小有關；形狀係數亦取決於基礎與取點，因此估算尺度不能冒充完整分層沉陷分析。本例明定理想彈性均質半空間及指定影響係數，不含一次壓密與次壓縮。模數以千帕一致代入，結果僅是此理想模型的位移尺度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「基礎彈性變形尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A foundation deforms before bearing failure, and differential settlement can open joints or reduce crest margin. Elastic half-space relations show scaling with pressure, width and stiffness, but soil modulus depends on stress level, drainage time and strain. Shape factors also depend on footing geometry and evaluation point, so a scale estimate cannot substitute for layered settlement analysis. The example specifies a uniform elastic half-space and assigned influence factor, excluding primary and secondary consolidation. Modulus is converted consistently to kilopascals; displacement belongs only to this idealized model. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Elastic foundation deformation scale” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設q=50 kPa、B=4 m、ν=0.30、E=20,000 kPa、影響係數I=1.0，s=qB(1−ν²)I/E=0.00910 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume q=50 kPa, B=4 m, Poisson ratio ν=0.30, E=20,000 kPa and influence I=1.0.","failure":"常見誤解：「計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「基礎彈性變形尺度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Elastic foundation deformation scale”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-21-k1","title":"基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證","titleEn":"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification","text":"牆基即使未達承載破壞也會變形，沉陷差可能使板段接頭張開或頂高失去餘量。彈性半空間公式可展示壓力、寬度與剛度的比例關係，但土模數與應力水準、排水時間及應變大小有關；形狀係數亦取決於基礎與取點，因此估算尺度不能冒充完整分層沉陷分析。","textEn":"A foundation deforms before bearing failure, and differential settlement can open joints or reduce crest margin. Elastic half-space relations show scaling with pressure, width and stiffness, but soil modulus depends on stress level, drainage time and strain.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["牆基即使未達承載破壞也會變形，沉陷差可能使板段接頭張開或頂高失去餘量。","計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。","朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。"],"optionsEn":["A foundation deforms before bearing failure, and differential settlement can open joints or reduce crest margin.","Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.","Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"牆基即使未達承載破壞也會變形，沉陷差可能使板段接頭張開或頂高失去餘量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A foundation deforms before bearing failure, and differential settlement can open joints or reduce crest margin. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b274-v15-22","title":"基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「基礎彈性變形尺度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Elastic foundation deformation scale” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設q=50 kPa、B=4 m、ν=0.30、E=20,000 kPa、影響係數I=1.0，s=qB(1−ν²)I/E=0.00910 m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume q=50 kPa, B=4 m, Poisson ratio ν=0.30, E=20,000 kPa and influence I=1.0. Elastic displacement scale s=0.00910 m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：確認所用模數和影響係數對應相同排水、應變及基礎條件，另查軟弱層厚度與時間效應。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Confirm modulus and influence factor match drainage, strain and footing conditions, then investigate weak-layer thickness and time effects separately.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設q=50 kPa、B=4 m、ν=0.30、E=20,000 kPa、影響係數I=1.0，s=qB(1−ν²)I/E=0.00910 m。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume q=50 kPa, B=4 m, Poisson ratio ν=0.30, E=20,000 kPa and influence I=1.0. Elastic displacement scale s=0.00910 m.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設q=50 kPa、B=4 m、ν=0.30、E=20,000 kPa、影響係數I=1.0，s=qB(1−ν²)I/E=0.00910 m。","水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。"],"optionsEn":["Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume q=50 kPa, B=4 m, Poisson ratio ν=0.30, E=20,000 kPa and influence I=1.0.","A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設q=50 kPa、B=4 m、ν=0.30、E=20,000 kPa、影響係數I=1.0，s=qB(1−ν²)I/E=0.00910 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume q=50 kPa, B=4 m, Poisson ratio ν=0.30, E=20,000 kPa and influence I=1.0. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b274-v15-23","title":"基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「基礎彈性變形尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Elastic foundation deformation scale” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"確認所用模數和影響係數對應相同排水、應變及基礎條件，另查軟弱層厚度與時間效應。以分段高程觀測比較相對沉陷，核對是否有剛體傾斜，再評估接頭可容許變位。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Confirm modulus and influence factor match drainage, strain and footing conditions, then investigate weak-layer thickness and time effects separately. Compare relative settlements from segment elevations, distinguish rigid-body tilt and assess joint movement capacity rather than relying only on one predicted absolute displacement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將模數減半而保持其餘條件不變，重算理想位移並列出未包含的時間效應。用相鄰牆段高程分開計算平均下沉和差異位移，避免混淆兩種使用性問題。","observationEn":"Site practice: Halve modulus with other assumptions fixed and recalculate elastic displacement, listing omitted time effects. Use adjacent segment elevations to separate average settlement from relative movement rather than confusing the two serviceability concerns.","failure":"注意干擾：把兆帕未換單位就與千帕荷載相除會產生千倍誤差，任選形狀係數也會使精度虛假；以瞬時彈性結果代表多年沉陷，則漏掉可能控制止水接頭的壓密差。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Dividing kilopascal loading by an unconverted megapascal modulus creates a thousand-fold error. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"確認所用模數和影響係數對應相同排水、應變及基礎條件，另查軟弱層厚度與時間效應。以分段高程觀測比較相對沉陷，核對是否有剛體傾斜，再評估接頭可容許變位。","textEn":"Confirm modulus and influence factor match drainage, strain and footing conditions, then investigate weak-layer thickness and time effects separately. Compare relative settlements from segment elevations, distinguish rigid-body tilt and assess joint movement capacity rather than relying only on one predicted absolute displacement.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將模數減半而保持其餘條件不變，重算理想位移並列出未包含的時間效應。用相鄰牆段高程分開計算平均下沉和差異位移，避免混淆兩種使用性問題。","textEn":"Halve modulus with other assumptions fixed and recalculate elastic displacement, listing omitted time effects. Use adjacent segment elevations to separate average settlement from relative movement rather than confusing the two serviceability concerns.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。","確認所用模數和影響係數對應相同排水、應變及基礎條件，另查軟弱層厚度與時間效應。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift.","Confirm modulus and influence factor match drainage, strain and footing conditions, then investigate weak-layer thickness and time effects separately."],"answer":2,"explanation":"確認所用模數和影響係數對應相同排水、應變及基礎條件，另查軟弱層厚度與時間效應。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Confirm modulus and influence factor match drainage, strain and footing conditions, then investigate weak-layer thickness and time effects separately. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b274-v15-24","title":"基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「基礎彈性變形尺度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Elastic foundation deformation scale” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把兆帕未換單位就與千帕荷載相除會產生千倍誤差，任選形狀係數也會使精度虛假；以瞬時彈性結果代表多年沉陷，則漏掉可能控制止水接頭的壓密差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Dividing kilopascal loading by an unconverted megapascal modulus creates a thousand-fold error. An arbitrary shape factor implies false precision, and treating instantaneous elasticity as years of settlement omits consolidation differences that can control waterstop performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：模數以千帕一致代入，結果僅是此理想模型的位移尺度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Modulus is converted consistently to kilopascals; displacement belongs only to this idealized model.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把兆帕未換單位就與千帕荷載相除會產生千倍誤差，任選形狀係數也會使精度虛假；以瞬時彈性結果代表多年沉陷，則漏掉可能控制止水接頭的壓密差。","textEn":"Dividing kilopascal loading by an unconverted megapascal modulus creates a thousand-fold error. An arbitrary shape factor implies false precision, and treating instantaneous elasticity as years of settlement omits consolidation differences that can control waterstop performance.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「基礎彈性變形尺度機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Elastic foundation deformation scale mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把兆帕未換單位就與千帕荷載相除會產生千倍誤差，任選形狀係數也會使精度虛假；以瞬時彈性結果代表多年沉陷，則漏掉可能控制止水接頭的壓密差。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。"],"optionsEn":["Dividing kilopascal loading by an unconverted megapascal modulus creates a thousand-fold error.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把兆帕未換單位就與千帕荷載相除會產生千倍誤差，任選形狀係數也會使精度虛假；以瞬時彈性結果代表多年沉陷，則漏掉可能控制止水接頭的壓密差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Dividing kilopascal loading by an unconverted megapascal modulus creates a thousand-fold error. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b274-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證」與「截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification\" and \"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b274-v15-25","title":"被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「被動土壓與可動員變形」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Passive pressure and mobilization” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"基礎前方土體可提供被動阻力，但充分動員通常需要位移，並受土面坡度、牆土摩擦和應力歷史影響。理想朗肯係數只適用特定無摩擦垂直面與水平地面，並非所有鋼板樁或剪力榫的抗力；前方沖刷與開挖還可能移除可用土體，需和牆的容許變形共同判斷。本例只算無黏乾砂、水平面、光滑直牆的理想係數，未算總抗力，也未宣稱已達被動狀態；飽和土需一致有效應力處理。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「被動土壓與可動員變形」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Soil ahead of a foundation can provide passive resistance, but full mobilization requires movement and depends on ground slope, interface friction and stress history. The ideal Rankine coefficient applies to a smooth vertical interface and level ground, not every sheet pile or shear key. Scour and excavation can remove the resisting soil, linking resistance to allowable wall movement. The example computes only an ideal coefficient for cohesionless dry sand, level ground and a smooth vertical wall. It neither gives total resistance nor establishes mobilization; saturated soil needs consistent effective-stress treatment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Passive pressure and mobilization” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設有效摩擦角φ′=30°，理想朗肯被動係數Kp=tan²(45°+φ′/2)=3.00，無單位。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume effective friction angle φ′=30°.","failure":"常見誤解：「朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「被動土壓與可動員變形」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Passive pressure and mobilization”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-25-k1","title":"被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證","titleEn":"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification","text":"基礎前方土體可提供被動阻力，但充分動員通常需要位移，並受土面坡度、牆土摩擦和應力歷史影響。理想朗肯係數只適用特定無摩擦垂直面與水平地面，並非所有鋼板樁或剪力榫的抗力；前方沖刷與開挖還可能移除可用土體，需和牆的容許變形共同判斷。","textEn":"Soil ahead of a foundation can provide passive resistance, but full mobilization requires movement and depends on ground slope, interface friction and stress history. The ideal Rankine coefficient applies to a smooth vertical interface and level ground, not every sheet pile or shear key.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。","基礎前方土體可提供被動阻力，但充分動員通常需要位移，並受土面坡度、牆土摩擦和應力歷史影響。","防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。"],"optionsEn":["Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance.","Soil ahead of a foundation can provide passive resistance, but full mobilization requires movement and depends on ground slope, interface friction and stress history.","A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location."],"answer":1,"explanation":"基礎前方土體可提供被動阻力，但充分動員通常需要位移，並受土面坡度、牆土摩擦和應力歷史影響。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Soil ahead of a foundation can provide passive resistance, but full mobilization requires movement and depends on ground slope, interface friction and stress history. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b274-v15-26","title":"被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「被動土壓與可動員變形」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Passive pressure and mobilization” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設有效摩擦角φ′=30°，理想朗肯被動係數Kp=tan²(45°+φ′/2)=3.00，無單位。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume effective friction angle φ′=30°. Ideal Rankine passive coefficient Kp=tan²(45°+φ′/2)=3.00, dimensionless, without a total-resistance claim. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對土面幾何、界面與地下水，列出需要動員被動阻力的方向及位移。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check ground geometry, interface and groundwater, identifying the movement needed to mobilize passive resistance.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設有效摩擦角φ′=30°，理想朗肯被動係數Kp=tan²(45°+φ′/2)=3.00，無單位。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume effective friction angle φ′=30°. Ideal Rankine passive coefficient Kp=tan²(45°+φ′/2)=3.00, dimensionless, without a total-resistance claim.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。","只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設有效摩擦角φ′=30°，理想朗肯被動係數Kp=tan²(45°+φ′/2)=3.00，無單位。"],"optionsEn":["Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together.","Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume effective friction angle φ′=30°."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設有效摩擦角φ′=30°，理想朗肯被動係數Kp=tan²(45°+φ′/2)=3.00，無單位。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume effective friction angle φ′=30°. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b274-v15-27","title":"被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「被動土壓與可動員變形」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Passive pressure and mobilization” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對土面幾何、界面與地下水，列出需要動員被動阻力的方向及位移。檢查前方土是否可能沖走、開挖或受管線擾動，再使用適合邊界的模型並與結構可接受變形比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check ground geometry, interface and groundwater, identifying the movement needed to mobilize passive resistance. Assess whether front soil can be scoured, excavated or disturbed by utilities, then choose a boundary-compatible model and compare its required deformation with structural serviceability limits. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：分別畫出未變形、局部動員與被動極限三種狀態，列出同一係數不能回答的問題。移除一層前方土後重新界定埋深，說明調查與維護介面的重要性。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw undeformed, partially mobilized and limiting passive states and list questions that one coefficient cannot answer. Remove a front-soil layer, redefine embedment and explain the investigation and maintenance implications of that changed geometry.","failure":"注意干擾：只要看到土在牆前就全額計入被動阻力，可能在小變形下高估抗力；漏掉未來開挖或沖刷情境，則讓原本依賴該土體的抗滑結果失去實體基礎。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Crediting full passive resistance merely because soil exists ahead of the wall can overstate resistance at small movements. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對土面幾何、界面與地下水，列出需要動員被動阻力的方向及位移。檢查前方土是否可能沖走、開挖或受管線擾動，再使用適合邊界的模型並與結構可接受變形比較。","textEn":"Check ground geometry, interface and groundwater, identifying the movement needed to mobilize passive resistance. Assess whether front soil can be scoured, excavated or disturbed by utilities, then choose a boundary-compatible model and compare its required deformation with structural serviceability limits.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"分別畫出未變形、局部動員與被動極限三種狀態，列出同一係數不能回答的問題。移除一層前方土後重新界定埋深，說明調查與維護介面的重要性。","textEn":"Draw undeformed, partially mobilized and limiting passive states and list questions that one coefficient cannot answer. Remove a front-soil layer, redefine embedment and explain the investigation and maintenance implications of that changed geometry.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification\"?","options":["核對土面幾何、界面與地下水，列出需要動員被動阻力的方向及位移。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。"],"optionsEn":["Check ground geometry, interface and groundwater, identifying the movement needed to mobilize passive resistance.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable."],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對土面幾何、界面與地下水，列出需要動員被動阻力的方向及位移。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check ground geometry, interface and groundwater, identifying the movement needed to mobilize passive resistance. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b274-v15-28","title":"被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「被動土壓與可動員變形」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Passive pressure and mobilization” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只要看到土在牆前就全額計入被動阻力，可能在小變形下高估抗力；漏掉未來開挖或沖刷情境，則讓原本依賴該土體的抗滑結果失去實體基礎。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Crediting full passive resistance merely because soil exists ahead of the wall can overstate resistance at small movements. Omitting future excavation or scour allows a sliding calculation to depend on material that may no longer be present. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例只算無黏乾砂、水平面、光滑直牆的理想係數，未算總抗力，也未宣稱已達被動狀態；飽和土需一致有效應力處理。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: It neither gives total resistance nor establishes mobilization; saturated soil needs consistent effective-stress treatment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只要看到土在牆前就全額計入被動阻力，可能在小變形下高估抗力；漏掉未來開挖或沖刷情境，則讓原本依賴該土體的抗滑結果失去實體基礎。","textEn":"Crediting full passive resistance merely because soil exists ahead of the wall can overstate resistance at small movements. Omitting future excavation or scour allows a sliding calculation to depend on material that may no longer be present.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「被動土壓與可動員變形機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Passive pressure and mobilization mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只要看到土在牆前就全額計入被動阻力，可能在小變形下高估抗力；漏掉未來開挖或沖刷情境，則讓原本依賴該土體的抗滑結果失去實體基礎。","防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Crediting full passive resistance merely because soil exists ahead of the wall can overstate resistance at small movements.","A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只要看到土在牆前就全額計入被動阻力，可能在小變形下高估抗力；漏掉未來開挖或沖刷情境，則讓原本依賴該土體的抗滑結果失去實體基礎。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Crediting full passive resistance merely because soil exists ahead of the wall can overstate resistance at small movements. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b274-v15-29","title":"截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「截水深度與滲透方向」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cutoff depth and seepage direction” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"牆基防滲構造不只減漏，也會改變底版揚壓和出口位置，深度增加可能使流路轉移至較深透水層。以均質流徑延長估算只表示水力阻抗尺度，實際需考慮二維或三維流線、層間異向性及牆尖梯度；總漏水下降不一定表示所有局部孔壓同步下降。本例使用指定長度的固定截面飽和一維路徑，水頭差與滲透係數不變。延長流路不是把實際牆深直接代入，也不提供出口侵蝕判定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「截水深度與滲透方向」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Foundation cutoffs reduce leakage but also redistribute uplift and exit locations; greater depth can redirect flow into deeper permeable strata. A lengthened uniform path gives only a resistance scale. Actual analysis needs two- or three-dimensional flow, anisotropic layers and tip gradients, because lower total discharge does not necessarily lower every local pore pressure. This example uses an assigned saturated one-dimensional path of constant area, head difference and conductivity. Path extension is not actual wall depth substituted directly, and it gives no exit-erosion acceptance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Cutoff depth and seepage direction” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s、A=10 m²、Δh=4 m、L=20 m，Q=kAΔh/L=4×10⁻⁶ m³/s；路徑40 m時為2×10⁻⁶ m³/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s, A=10 m², Δh=4 m and L=20 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「截水深度與滲透方向」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Cutoff depth and seepage direction”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-29-k1","title":"截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證","titleEn":"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification","text":"牆基防滲構造不只減漏，也會改變底版揚壓和出口位置，深度增加可能使流路轉移至較深透水層。以均質流徑延長估算只表示水力阻抗尺度，實際需考慮二維或三維流線、層間異向性及牆尖梯度；總漏水下降不一定表示所有局部孔壓同步下降。","textEn":"Foundation cutoffs reduce leakage but also redistribute uplift and exit locations; greater depth can redirect flow into deeper permeable strata. A lengthened uniform path gives only a resistance scale.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。","兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。","牆基防滲構造不只減漏，也會改變底版揚壓和出口位置，深度增加可能使流路轉移至較深透水層。"],"optionsEn":["A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location.","Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness.","Foundation cutoffs reduce leakage but also redistribute uplift and exit locations; greater depth can redirect flow into deeper permeable strata."],"answer":2,"explanation":"牆基防滲構造不只減漏，也會改變底版揚壓和出口位置，深度增加可能使流路轉移至較深透水層。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Foundation cutoffs reduce leakage but also redistribute uplift and exit locations; greater depth can redirect flow into deeper permeable strata. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b274-v15-30","title":"截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「截水深度與滲透方向」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cutoff depth and seepage direction” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s、A=10 m²、Δh=4 m、L=20 m，Q=kAΔh/L=4×10⁻⁶ m³/s；路徑40 m時為2×10⁻⁶ m³/s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s, A=10 m², Δh=4 m and L=20 m. Q=4×10⁻⁶ m³/s; increasing the ideal path to 40 m halves it. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在剖面標出地層、牆尖、排水與總水頭邊界，檢查是否存在繞流或高透水夾層。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map layers, cutoff tip, drains and total-head boundaries and inspect bypass and permeable interlayers.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s、A=10 m²、Δh=4 m、L=20 m，Q=kAΔh/L=4×10⁻⁶ m³/s；路徑40 m時為2×10⁻⁶ m³/s。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s, A=10 m², Δh=4 m and L=20 m. Q=4×10⁻⁶ m³/s; increasing the ideal path to 40 m halves it.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s、A=10 m²、Δh=4 m、L=20 m，Q=kAΔh/L=4×10⁻⁶ m³/s。","水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。","底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s, A=10 m², Δh=4 m and L=20 m.","A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent.","Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s、A=10 m²、Δh=4 m、L=20 m，Q=kAΔh/L=4×10⁻⁶ m³/s；路徑40 m時為2×10⁻⁶ m³/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume k=2×10⁻⁶ m/s, A=10 m², Δh=4 m and L=20 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b274-v15-31","title":"截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「截水深度與滲透方向」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cutoff depth and seepage direction” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在剖面標出地層、牆尖、排水與總水頭邊界，檢查是否存在繞流或高透水夾層。比較有無防滲構造時的揚壓分布及局部出口梯度，用實測孔壓和流量共同驗證而非只看漏水總數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map layers, cutoff tip, drains and total-head boundaries and inspect bypass and permeable interlayers. Compare uplift distributions and local exit gradients with and without the cutoff, validating against both measured pressure and discharge rather than total leakage alone as the performance metric. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：對一維模型改變流長，另外畫一條繞牆尖的替代路徑。列出需要二維分析才能比較的孔壓位置，說明流量減半不等於每一處梯度減半。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change path length in the one-dimensional model and draw a separate route around the cutoff tip. Identify pressure locations needing two-dimensional analysis and explain why halved discharge does not imply halved gradient everywhere.","failure":"注意干擾：把牆深誤當全部流徑會扭曲流量，忽略透水夾層可能低估繞流；如果只根據總漏水變小宣稱穩定改善，就可能漏掉牆尖或出口附近集中的不利梯度。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Treating cutoff depth as the entire flow path distorts discharge, and an omitted permeable layer understates bypass. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在剖面標出地層、牆尖、排水與總水頭邊界，檢查是否存在繞流或高透水夾層。比較有無防滲構造時的揚壓分布及局部出口梯度，用實測孔壓和流量共同驗證而非只看漏水總數。","textEn":"Map layers, cutoff tip, drains and total-head boundaries and inspect bypass and permeable interlayers. Compare uplift distributions and local exit gradients with and without the cutoff, validating against both measured pressure and discharge rather than total leakage alone as the performance metric.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"對一維模型改變流長，另外畫一條繞牆尖的替代路徑。列出需要二維分析才能比較的孔壓位置，說明流量減半不等於每一處梯度減半。","textEn":"Change path length in the one-dimensional model and draw a separate route around the cutoff tip. Identify pressure locations needing two-dimensional analysis and explain why halved discharge does not imply halved gradient everywhere.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","在剖面標出地層、牆尖、排水與總水頭邊界，檢查是否存在繞流或高透水夾層。","極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Map layers, cutoff tip, drains and total-head boundaries and inspect bypass and permeable interlayers.","Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在剖面標出地層、牆尖、排水與總水頭邊界，檢查是否存在繞流或高透水夾層。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map layers, cutoff tip, drains and total-head boundaries and inspect bypass and permeable interlayers. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b274-v15-32","title":"截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「截水深度與滲透方向」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Cutoff depth and seepage direction” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把牆深誤當全部流徑會扭曲流量，忽略透水夾層可能低估繞流；如果只根據總漏水變小宣稱穩定改善，就可能漏掉牆尖或出口附近集中的不利梯度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Treating cutoff depth as the entire flow path distorts discharge, and an omitted permeable layer understates bypass. Claiming improved stability solely from reduced leakage can miss adverse gradients concentrated near a cutoff tip or exit. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：延長流路不是把實際牆深直接代入，也不提供出口侵蝕判定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Path extension is not actual wall depth substituted directly, and it gives no exit-erosion acceptance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「防滲牆越深時，所有位置的孔壓與出口梯度必定同時降低。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A deeper cutoff necessarily lowers pore pressure and exit gradient at every location.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把牆深誤當全部流徑會扭曲流量，忽略透水夾層可能低估繞流；如果只根據總漏水變小宣稱穩定改善，就可能漏掉牆尖或出口附近集中的不利梯度。","textEn":"Treating cutoff depth as the entire flow path distorts discharge, and an omitted permeable layer understates bypass. Claiming improved stability solely from reduced leakage can miss adverse gradients concentrated near a cutoff tip or exit.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「截水深度與滲透方向機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cutoff depth and seepage direction mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。","把牆深誤當全部流徑會扭曲流量，忽略透水夾層可能低估繞流；如果只根據總漏水變小宣稱穩定改善，就可能漏掉牆尖或出口附近集中的不利梯度。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness.","Treating cutoff depth as the entire flow path distorts discharge, and an omitted permeable layer understates bypass."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把牆深誤當全部流徑會扭曲流量，忽略透水夾層可能低估繞流；如果只根據總漏水變小宣稱穩定改善，就可能漏掉牆尖或出口附近集中的不利梯度。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating cutoff depth as the entire flow path distorts discharge, and an omitted permeable layer understates bypass. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b274-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證」與「退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification\" and \"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b274-v15-33","title":"差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「差異沉陷與止水接頭」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Differential movement and waterstops” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"相鄰牆段的位移差會改變止水材料與接頭幾何，整段平均沉陷很小仍可能在轉折或地層變化處集中變形。以兩測點高差除距離只能得到平均沉陷斜率，未扣剛體轉動時不能直接叫構件角變形；接頭還可能受到開口、剪移和轉角的組合作用，需要與可驗證的材料容許值比較。本例僅為兩點高差的幾何平均斜率，未分解牆段剛體傾斜或局部曲率；不能單憑這個比值計算止水接觸壓力或證明水密。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「差異沉陷與止水接頭」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Relative movement between wall segments changes waterstop and joint geometry, and a small average settlement can conceal concentration at bends or layer transitions. Elevation difference divided by spacing gives a mean settlement slope, not automatically component angular distortion before removing rigid-body rotation. Joints also experience combined opening, shear and rotation that require validated material capacities. This is only the geometric mean slope between two points, without separation of rigid-body tilt or local curvature. It cannot calculate waterstop contact pressure or establish watertightness. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Differential movement and waterstops” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設兩測點沉陷s1=8 mm、s2=20 mm、間距L=6 m，平均沉陷斜率Δs/L=0.012/6=0.002 m/m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume settlements s1=8 mm and s2=20 mm separated by L=6 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「差異沉陷與止水接頭」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Differential movement and waterstops”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-33-k1","title":"差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證","titleEn":"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification","text":"相鄰牆段的位移差會改變止水材料與接頭幾何，整段平均沉陷很小仍可能在轉折或地層變化處集中變形。以兩測點高差除距離只能得到平均沉陷斜率，未扣剛體轉動時不能直接叫構件角變形；接頭還可能受到開口、剪移和轉角的組合作用，需要與可驗證的材料容許值比較。","textEn":"Relative movement between wall segments changes waterstop and joint geometry, and a small average settlement can conceal concentration at bends or layer transitions. Elevation difference divided by spacing gives a mean settlement slope, not automatically component angular distortion before removing rigid-body rotation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["相鄰牆段的位移差會改變止水材料與接頭幾何，整段平均沉陷很小仍可能在轉折或地層變化處集中變形。","兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。","外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。"],"optionsEn":["Relative movement between wall segments changes waterstop and joint geometry, and a small average settlement can conceal concentration at bends or layer transitions.","Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness.","Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相鄰牆段的位移差會改變止水材料與接頭幾何，整段平均沉陷很小仍可能在轉折或地層變化處集中變形。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Relative movement between wall segments changes waterstop and joint geometry, and a small average settlement can conceal concentration at bends or layer transitions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b274-v15-34","title":"差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「差異沉陷與止水接頭」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Differential movement and waterstops” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設兩測點沉陷s1=8 mm、s2=20 mm、間距L=6 m，平均沉陷斜率Δs/L=0.012/6=0.002 m/m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume settlements s1=8 mm and s2=20 mm separated by L=6 m. Mean settlement slope Δs/L=0.012/6=0.002 m/m, without a waterstop-capacity claim. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：統一測點高程基準與時間，增加牆段內測點以區分整體傾斜與彎曲。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Align survey datum and time and add points within segments to distinguish tilt from curvature.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設兩測點沉陷s1=8 mm、s2=20 mm、間距L=6 m，平均沉陷斜率Δs/L=0.012/6=0.002 m/m。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume settlements s1=8 mm and s2=20 mm separated by L=6 m. Mean settlement slope Δs/L=0.012/6=0.002 m/m, without a waterstop-capacity claim.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["只要揚壓總力算對，它作用在底版何處就完全不影響穩定。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設兩測點沉陷s1=8 mm、s2=20 mm、間距L=6 m，平均沉陷斜率Δs/L=0.012/6=0.002 m/m。","底面最小壓力大於零，就足以證明承載、沉陷與牆身強度全都合格。"],"optionsEn":["Correct total uplift makes its position beneath the footing irrelevant to stability.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume settlements s1=8 mm and s2=20 mm separated by L=6 m.","Positive minimum footing pressure proves bearing, settlement and wall strength all acceptable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設兩測點沉陷s1=8 mm、s2=20 mm、間距L=6 m，平均沉陷斜率Δs/L=0.012/6=0.002 m/m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume settlements s1=8 mm and s2=20 mm separated by L=6 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b274-v15-35","title":"差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「差異沉陷與止水接頭」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Differential movement and waterstops” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"統一測點高程基準與時間，增加牆段內測點以區分整體傾斜與彎曲。量測接頭開口和剪移，取得止水材料在相應溫度、老化與壓差下的性能資料，並以適當漏水測試核對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Align survey datum and time and add points within segments to distinguish tilt from curvature. Measure opening and shear and obtain waterstop performance at relevant temperature, aging and pressure difference, checking with appropriate leakage tests rather than inferring sealing behavior from two elevations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用三個以上測點分解一個假設的剛體傾斜與局部相對變形，另列開口與剪移。說明仍須哪些材料曲線與漏水試驗，才能連結幾何量測和止水性能。","observationEn":"Site practice: Use at least three points to separate a hypothetical rigid tilt from local relative movement, listing opening and shear independently. Explain which material curves and leakage tests are still required to connect geometry with sealing performance.","failure":"注意干擾：將平均斜率當全部接頭轉角可能錯配性能試驗，忽略剪移和開口組合也會漏掉止水失效；只用目視無裂縫判斷水密，則無法確認隱藏止水材料或接續完整。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Treating mean slope as the entire joint rotation misapplies performance tests, while ignoring combined shear and opening misses seal failure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"統一測點高程基準與時間，增加牆段內測點以區分整體傾斜與彎曲。量測接頭開口和剪移，取得止水材料在相應溫度、老化與壓差下的性能資料，並以適當漏水測試核對。","textEn":"Align survey datum and time and add points within segments to distinguish tilt from curvature. Measure opening and shear and obtain waterstop performance at relevant temperature, aging and pressure difference, checking with appropriate leakage tests rather than inferring sealing behavior from two elevations.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用三個以上測點分解一個假設的剛體傾斜與局部相對變形，另列開口與剪移。說明仍須哪些材料曲線與漏水試驗，才能連結幾何量測和止水性能。","textEn":"Use at least three points to separate a hypothetical rigid tilt from local relative movement, listing opening and shear independently. Explain which material curves and leakage tests are still required to connect geometry with sealing performance.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","計算得到小的瞬時彈性沉陷，就能排除所有長期接頭變形。","統一測點高程基準與時間，增加牆段內測點以區分整體傾斜與彎曲。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Small calculated instantaneous elastic settlement excludes every long-term joint movement problem.","Align survey datum and time and add points within segments to distinguish tilt from curvature."],"answer":2,"explanation":"統一測點高程基準與時間，增加牆段內測點以區分整體傾斜與彎曲。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Align survey datum and time and add points within segments to distinguish tilt from curvature. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b274-v15-36","title":"差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「差異沉陷與止水接頭」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Differential movement and waterstops” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"將平均斜率當全部接頭轉角可能錯配性能試驗，忽略剪移和開口組合也會漏掉止水失效；只用目視無裂縫判斷水密，則無法確認隱藏止水材料或接續完整。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Treating mean slope as the entire joint rotation misapplies performance tests, while ignoring combined shear and opening misses seal failure. No visible crack does not confirm the integrity of hidden waterstops, connections or their response under pressure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例僅為兩點高差的幾何平均斜率，未分解牆段剛體傾斜或局部曲率；不能單憑這個比值計算止水接觸壓力或證明水密。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: It cannot calculate waterstop contact pressure or establish watertightness.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「兩個高程點的沉陷斜率可直接換算止水接頭接觸壓力與水密保證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Settlement slope from two elevations directly gives waterstop contact pressure and guaranteed watertightness.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"將平均斜率當全部接頭轉角可能錯配性能試驗，忽略剪移和開口組合也會漏掉止水失效；只用目視無裂縫判斷水密，則無法確認隱藏止水材料或接續完整。","textEn":"Treating mean slope as the entire joint rotation misapplies performance tests, while ignoring combined shear and opening misses seal failure. No visible crack does not confirm the integrity of hidden waterstops, connections or their response under pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「差異沉陷與止水接頭機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Differential movement and waterstops mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["將平均斜率當全部接頭轉角可能錯配性能試驗，忽略剪移和開口組合也會漏掉止水失效；只用目視無裂縫判斷水密，則無法確認隱藏止水材料或接續完整。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。"],"optionsEn":["Treating mean slope as the entire joint rotation misapplies performance tests, while ignoring combined shear and opening misses seal failure.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將平均斜率當全部接頭轉角可能錯配性能試驗，忽略剪移和開口組合也會漏掉止水失效；只用目視無裂縫判斷水密，則無法確認隱藏止水材料或接續完整。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating mean slope as the entire joint rotation misapplies performance tests, while ignoring combined shear and opening misses seal failure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b274-v15-37","title":"退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「退水與反向荷載情境」如何影響防洪牆基礎設計的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Recession and reversed loading” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Floodwall foundation design”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"洪水退去後，背側積水或地基孔壓可能尚未消散，原本抵抗外河水的牆會遇到不同方向或分布的作用。水位變化、抽排和排水堵塞應以時間一致的荷載組合處理，不能把各自最大值任意拼湊也不能只檢查最高河水位；反向荷載還可能動員不同界面及接觸區域。本例兩側直牆水深由同一底面量起，取外河向背側為正，僅相減兩個靜水合力；未包含基底揚壓或土壓。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「退水與反向荷載情境」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After river recession, retained water or foundation pressure may persist, changing the direction and distribution of wall loads. Stage change, pumping and blocked drainage need time-consistent combinations, neither arbitrary combinations of unrelated maxima nor only peak river stage. Reversed loading may also mobilize different interfaces, contacts and structural reinforcement than the original forward case. Depths on both vertical faces share the same base, with river-to-landward force positive. The example subtracts two hydrostatic resultants only, excluding base uplift and earth pressure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Recession and reversed loading” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³，外河水深ho=0.5 m、背側hi=1.5 m，淨力F=γw(ho²−hi²)/2=−9.81 kN/m，方向朝河。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γw=9.81 kN/m³, river depth ho=0.5 m and rear depth hi=1.5 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「退水與反向荷載情境」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Recession and reversed loading”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-37-k1","title":"退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證","titleEn":"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification","text":"洪水退去後，背側積水或地基孔壓可能尚未消散，原本抵抗外河水的牆會遇到不同方向或分布的作用。水位變化、抽排和排水堵塞應以時間一致的荷載組合處理，不能把各自最大值任意拼湊也不能只檢查最高河水位；反向荷載還可能動員不同界面及接觸區域。","textEn":"After river recession, retained water or foundation pressure may persist, changing the direction and distribution of wall loads. Stage change, pumping and blocked drainage need time-consistent combinations, neither arbitrary combinations of unrelated maxima nor only peak river stage.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。","洪水退去後，背側積水或地基孔壓可能尚未消散，原本抵抗外河水的牆會遇到不同方向或分布的作用。","水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。"],"optionsEn":["Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together.","After river recession, retained water or foundation pressure may persist, changing the direction and distribution of wall loads.","A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent."],"answer":1,"explanation":"洪水退去後，背側積水或地基孔壓可能尚未消散，原本抵抗外河水的牆會遇到不同方向或分布的作用。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After river recession, retained water or foundation pressure may persist, changing the direction and distribution of wall loads. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b274-v15-38","title":"退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「退水與反向荷載情境」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Recession and reversed loading” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³，外河水深ho=0.5 m、背側hi=1.5 m，淨力F=γw(ho²−hi²)/2=−9.81 kN/m，方向朝河。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γw=9.81 kN/m³, river depth ho=0.5 m and rear depth hi=1.5 m. Net F=γw(ho²−hi²)/2=−9.81 kN/m, directed riverward. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將兩側水位、孔壓與泵站狀態畫在同一時間軸，檢查洪峰、退水及抽排失效。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot both stages, pore pressure and pump state on one time axis and examine peak, recession and pumping failure.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³，外河水深ho=0.5 m、背側hi=1.5 m，淨力F=γw(ho²−hi²)/2=−9.81 kN/m，方向朝河。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γw=9.81 kN/m³, river depth ho=0.5 m and rear depth hi=1.5 m. Net F=γw(ho²−hi²)/2=−9.81 kN/m, directed riverward.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["底版摩擦永遠由全部自重決定，地下水揚壓不會改變抗滑力。","極限承載力就是工程可長期使用的容許壓力，不需檢查沉陷。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³，外河水深ho=0.5 m、背側hi=1.5 m，淨力F=γw(ho²−hi²)/2=−9.81 kN/m，方向朝河。"],"optionsEn":["Base friction always uses full self-weight and is unaffected by groundwater uplift.","Ultimate bearing capacity is the permissible long-term service pressure without settlement checks.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γw=9.81 kN/m³, river depth ho=0.5 m and rear depth hi=1.5 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設γw=9.81 kN/m³，外河水深ho=0.5 m、背側hi=1.5 m，淨力F=γw(ho²−hi²)/2=−9.81 kN/m，方向朝河。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γw=9.81 kN/m³, river depth ho=0.5 m and rear depth hi=1.5 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b274-v15-39","title":"退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「退水與反向荷載情境」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Recession and reversed loading” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將兩側水位、孔壓與泵站狀態畫在同一時間軸，檢查洪峰、退水及抽排失效。明列正負方向和不同作用點，追蹤反向彎矩與接觸區變化，再檢查止水和排水是否可在兩向壓差下運作。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot both stages, pore pressure and pump state on one time axis and examine peak, recession and pumping failure. State signs and lever arms, trace reversed moments and changing contact regions and check whether seals and drainage can function under pressure differences in both directions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：建立河水先降而背水暫留的三個時點，逐一計算淨力方向。另畫可能延遲的底版孔壓，說明需要時間相容荷載而不能只挑最高河水位。","observationEn":"Site practice: Create three times with falling river water and temporarily retained rear water, calculating force direction at each. Sketch delayed footing pressures and explain why time-consistent loads are needed instead of choosing only the maximum river stage.","failure":"注意干擾：只以外河最高水位驗算會漏掉退水後背側水壓，直接用水深差平方又抹掉兩側共同底面幾何；忽略孔壓消散較慢也會使基礎有效載重的時程不合理。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Checking only peak river stage misses rear water during recession. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將兩側水位、孔壓與泵站狀態畫在同一時間軸，檢查洪峰、退水及抽排失效。明列正負方向和不同作用點，追蹤反向彎矩與接觸區變化，再檢查止水和排水是否可在兩向壓差下運作。","textEn":"Plot both stages, pore pressure and pump state on one time axis and examine peak, recession and pumping failure. State signs and lever arms, trace reversed moments and changing contact regions and check whether seals and drainage can function under pressure differences in both directions.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"建立河水先降而背水暫留的三個時點，逐一計算淨力方向。另畫可能延遲的底版孔壓，說明需要時間相容荷載而不能只挑最高河水位。","textEn":"Create three times with falling river water and temporarily retained rear water, calculating force direction at each. Sketch delayed footing pressures and explain why time-consistent loads are needed instead of choosing only the maximum river stage.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification\"?","options":["將兩側水位、孔壓與泵站狀態畫在同一時間軸，檢查洪峰、退水及抽排失效。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","朗肯被動係數算出後，任何微小位移都能立即動員全部被動抗力。"],"optionsEn":["Plot both stages, pore pressure and pump state on one time axis and examine peak, recession and pumping failure.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Once the Rankine coefficient is calculated, any tiny displacement immediately mobilizes full passive resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將兩側水位、孔壓與泵站狀態畫在同一時間軸，檢查洪峰、退水及抽排失效。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot both stages, pore pressure and pump state on one time axis and examine peak, recession and pumping failure. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b274-v15-40","title":"退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"prerequisiteIds":["b274-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「退水與反向荷載情境」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Recession and reversed loading” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只以外河最高水位驗算會漏掉退水後背側水壓，直接用水深差平方又抹掉兩側共同底面幾何；忽略孔壓消散較慢也會使基礎有效載重的時程不合理。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Checking only peak river stage misses rear water during recession. Squaring the depth difference loses the shared-base geometry, and ignoring slower pore-pressure dissipation produces an inconsistent time history of effective foundation loading and resistance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例兩側直牆水深由同一底面量起，取外河向背側為正，僅相減兩個靜水合力；未包含基底揚壓或土壓。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The example subtracts two hydrostatic resultants only, excluding base uplift and earth pressure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「外河水位一旦下降，防洪牆受到的所有荷載與風險就必定同步減少。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once river stage falls, every floodwall load and failure risk necessarily decreases together.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b274-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只以外河最高水位驗算會漏掉退水後背側水壓，直接用水深差平方又抹掉兩側共同底面幾何；忽略孔壓消散較慢也會使基礎有效載重的時程不合理。","textEn":"Checking only peak river stage misses rear water during recession. Squaring the depth difference loses the shared-base geometry, and ignoring slower pore-pressure dissipation produces an inconsistent time history of effective foundation loading and resistance.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]},{"id":"b274-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「退水與反向荷載情境機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Recession and reversed loading mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","只以外河最高水位驗算會漏掉退水後背側水壓，直接用水深差平方又抹掉兩側共同底面幾何；忽略孔壓消散較慢也會使基礎有效載重的時程不合理。","水深增加一成時，防洪牆的底部水壓力矩也只增加一成。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Checking only peak river stage misses rear water during recession.","A ten-percent increase in depth increases hydrostatic base moment by only ten percent."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只以外河最高水位驗算會漏掉退水後背側水壓，直接用水深差平方又抹掉兩側共同底面幾何；忽略孔壓消散較慢也會使基礎有效載重的時程不合理。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Checking only peak river stage misses rear water during recession. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-walls","v4-related-7afab40b0a57","v15s-ea-bewdley","v15s-ea-boston"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
